  "body": "debian jessie\nmatrix-synapse 0.18.1-1\npython-ldap3 0.9.4.2-1\n\n```\nldap_config:\n  enabled: true\n  uri: \"ldap1.example.com\"\n  start_tls: false\n  base: \"ou=users,dc=example,dc=com\"\n  attributes:\n    uid: \"uid\"\n    mail: \"mail\"\n    name: \"cn\"\n```\n\nsetting `start_tls: true` and in log:\n\n```\nsynapse.handlers.auth - 552 - WARNING - POST-8- Error during LDAP authentication: unable to send message, socket is not open\n```\n\nadding `ldap://` or `ldaps://` or port in `uri` doesn't have any effect.\n\nsetting `start_tls: false` works.\n\nldap server certificate is \"green\" and root ca certificates are in ca-certificates.\n",
